# Autolabel_Facemocap

Automated non-rigid facial marker labeling for marker-based motion capture data.

This repository accompanies the manuscript:

> Marcellin F, Rodriguez E, Raoult M, Le Moing A-G, Colin E, Sarhan F-R, Dakpé S.
> *Automated non-rigid facial marker labeling enables reliable and scalable
> analysis of facial motion.*
> Journal of NeuroEngineering and Rehabilitation (under review).

[![Python 3.11](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.11-blue.svg)](https://www.python.org/)
[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](LICENSE)

